  "overview": "The Racing Game with an Attitude\n\nThe world's most notorious speed demon pushes the 32-bit speed limit into extreme overdrive in a twisting, turning, upside-down-corkscrewing race for the finish line. Compete with 4 different characters - plus special \"hidden\" track smokers - and satisfy your need for speed through 5 blistering circuits. This wicked band of Mach-maniacs is sporting enough torque to keep you flossing bug guts out of your teeth for days.\n\nIt's time to cut your Saturn loose."
